10 REM HELLO WORLD - APPLE 1 INTEGER BASIC
20 REM THE DISPLAY TAKES ONE CHARACTER PER VIDEO FIELD, SO IT WRITES
30 REM SIXTY CHARACTERS A SECOND AND CANNOT BE HURRIED. A NARROW WAVE
40 REM DOWN THE SCREEN IS WHAT THAT BUYS: EVERY LINE IS CHEAP, AND THE
50 REM HARDWARE SCROLL DOES THE REST.
60 PRINT "     APPLE 1 - INTEGER BASIC"
70 PRINT
80 T=2
90 D=1
100 FOR I=1 TO 40
110 TAB T
120 PRINT "HELLO, WORLD!"
130 T=T+D
140 IF T>26 THEN D=-1
150 IF T<2 THEN D=1
160 NEXT I
170 PRINT
180 PRINT "     GOODBYE."
190 END
